; =============================================================================
;  BALE CLAMP — Mitsubishi LPG chassis (shared with Forklift) + clamp plates
;  on the mast carriage instead of forks. Cab interior, ROPS, counterweight,
;  LPG tank, hood, and tool slots ALL mirror Forklift.tscn — the only mast
;  difference is LeftPlate/RightPlate (curved-cap vertical paddles).
; =============================================================================

